  "id": "empathy-training",
  "term": "empathy training",
  "definition": "Empathy training is organized instruction designed to help service workers strengthen empathy in their interactions with the people they serve. In the reviewed literature, it commonly aims to build skills such as communication, relationship building, emotional resilience, and counselling-related skills.",
